OL,3,AVanessa Trump says she is cancer-free
OL,4,Asix months after revealing diagnosis
OL,5,
OL,6,FVanessa Trump, the former wife of
OL,7,FDonald Trump Jr, has announced that she
OL,8,Fis cancer-free following her breast
OL,9,Fcancer diagnosis earlier this year.
OL,11,FTrump, 48, who has five children with
OL,12,FPresident Donald Trump's eldest son,
OL,13,Fshared in a short video on her
OL,14,F19-year-old daughter Kai's Instagram
OL,15,Faccount that her recent tests results
OL,16,F"came back clear, so I'm finally
OL,17,Fcancer-free".
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
