OL,3,AVanessa Trump says she is cancer-free
OL,4,Asix months after revealing diagnosis
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing the Instagram post on Friday,
OL,7,FVanessa and Kai Trump released a longer
OL,8,Fvideo on Saturday, in which they
OL,9,Fdiscussed breast cancer awareness,
OL,10,Fearly detection and prevention.
OL,12,FVanessa Trump separated from Trump Jr
OL,13,Fin 2018 and announced last year that
OL,14,Fshe had begun dating US pro golfer
OL,15,FTiger Woods.
